      "comment": "STEREOPHONIC (1) boasts a strong record this journey here with four wins and four minors from nine tries. Below best last time at this track (23.20) in a Grade 5, finishing a 11 length seventh. With a clean break looks hard to beat. GAME CHANGER (2) had the drop on the lead and went on to be beaten 0.8 lengths into second (22.54) at this track in a Grade 5 over 400m. Got the money at his only try from this box. Overdue and expected to feature again. TARAWI REX (6) was well fancied in betting last start but could only manage 2.25 lengths away in third (22.55). Expected to be in this for a long way. PARISIAN JET (8) has claims fresh from a recent placing at big odds.",
